OL,3,GNEWSAViolent disorder charge over
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with violent
OL,7,Fdisorder following an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fdemonstration in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FA large crowd of protesters gathered at
OL,11,FEastney Marina after a boat carrying
OL,12,Fabout 120 migrants was brought ashore
OL,13,Fafter crossing the Channel at nearby
OL,14,FEastney Beach on 6 September.
OL,16,FHampshire Police said Bradley Pinnock,
OL,17,Fof Hayling Island, had been charged
OL,18,Fwith one count of violent disorder.
OL,20,FThe 29-year-old is due appear at
OL,21,FPortsmouth Magistrates' Court later.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
